(684, '3530100053122', 'Cindy Bruyere, Chainarong Raktham, James Done, Jiemjai Kreasuwun, Chitrlada Thongbai, and Wonchai Promnopas, Major weather regime changes over Southeast Asia in a near-term future scenario, Climate Research, Inter Research, Vol 72, No. 1, pages 1-18, doi:10.3354/cr01442 2016 (2015, IF=2.67)', '2558', 1, '2021-07-02 11:29:00', NULL),
