(751, '3640500414181', 'Villano, R., Khrueathai, P and Fleming, E. “Does a Rising Tide Life Boats? The Case of Vertical \r\nStrategic Alliances Involving Housewives Groups in Northern Thailand”. ASEAN Journal of \r\nEconomics, Management and Accounting 1(1), 2013.', '2556', 4, '2021-07-17 12:55:48', NULL),
