(725, '3540400448041', 'Noradechanunt C, Groeller H, Worsley A. A randomized controlled trial of Thai Yoga and Tai Chi exercises for improving functional fitness and quality of life in older adults. Conference proceeding of the 2012 Annual Meeting of the International Society for Behavioral Nutrition and Physical Activity 2012, Austin, Texas, USA; 2012.', '2555', '2022-11-01 22:06:49', ''),
